# Task 146-008 Execution Plan

## Objective
Fix DIRECTIVES.md mid-sprint deletion bug by adding phase guard to archiveDirectives().

## Root Cause
archiveDirectives() has no phase check — if called during EXECUTE or other non-CLEANUP phases,
it overwrites DIRECTIVES.md with a placeholder template. Sprint 144+145 confirmed this pattern.

## Changes

### 1. src/orchestra/sprint-docs-updater.ts
- Add optional `phase` parameter to `archiveDirectives()`
- Add phase guard: only allow execution when phase is 'CLEANUP' or 'COMPLETE' (or undefined for backward compat)
- Add `emergencyRestoreDirectives()` function for mid-sprint recovery from task JSONs

### 2. src/orchestra/sprint-finalizer.ts
- Pass phase info ('CLEANUP') to archiveDirectives() call at line 1001

### 3. tests/orchestra/archive-directives-phase.test.ts (NEW)
- 7 tests covering PLAN/EXECUTE/FIX/RETRO/CLEANUP phase behavior
- Emergency restore test
- Sprint 145 scenario simulation

## Verify
- tsc --noEmit
- npx vitest run tests/orchestra/archive-directives-phase.test.ts
